  <item>
    <title>Griffin: data center moratorium — Expired</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/griffin-ga</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-griffin-ga</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>Board of Commissioners unanimously approved a 180-day moratorium on &#x27;technological facilities&#x27; including data centers and cryptocurrency mining. UDC amendments adopted May 26, 2026 allow data centers only by special use permit in Planned Industrial districts and bar hyperscale campuses.</description>
  </item>
